{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecordingIndex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecordingIndex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedWordRecovery","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecording"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_eq_qAppendSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_eq_qAppendSteps","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L97-L101","doc":"**At the empty tableau** — the form the RSK inverse consumes: `Q(w)` is the result of appending\n`0, 1, …, |w|-1` at the rows `rowIndices [] w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRecAux_snd_eq_qAppendSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRecAux_snd_eq_qAppendSteps","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L85-L95","doc":"**The whole fold.** `Q` is grown by appending each timestamp at its step's insertion row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps_cons","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L82-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps_nil","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L80-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppendSteps","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L75-L78","doc":"Iterated `qAppend`: write timestamps `s, s+1, …` at the given rows, in order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertRec_snd_eq_qAppend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertRec_snd_eq_qAppend","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L53-L73","doc":"**One step: the recording write happens at the insertion row.**\n\n`insertRec`'s `Q`-bookkeeping is `qAppend` at `newRowIndex P x` — the very index brick 2 defined\nfrom `insert`'s recursion. The two notions of \"which row grew\" are the same notion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend_succ","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L50-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend_zero","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L47-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qAppend","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingIndex.lean#L40-L45","doc":"**Write a timestamp at the end of a row.** `qAppend Q i s` appends `s` to `Q`'s row `i`,\nreading rows with `headD`/`tail` exactly as `insertRec` does — so a row index past the end creates\nthe row rather than failing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}